  "description": "XDoc.Excel is a C# Office Excel library to read, convert, edit, create MS-Excel (.xlsx) documents in .NET framework projects.\n\nXDoc.Excel from RasterEdge is an advanced Microsoft Excel library :\n * Generate Excel from scratch\n * Convert Excel to PDF, SVG, HTML, multi-page TIFF, JPG, PNG and many raster image formats\n * Edit, process, merge Excel document\n\nCompatible with\n* .NET Framework 4.x, 3.x, 2.x\n* Windows, MacOS, Linux, Docker, Azure\n\nOnline Documents\n* C# How to Guide : https://www.rasteredge.com/how-to/csharp-imaging/excel-reading/\n* Email : support@rasteredge.com",
